        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The graph shows the percentage of people visiting the cinema once a month or more between 1984 and 2003 (4 age groups). Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EBuRdGfGAoiExPxm6JnllRH6gQh\"><em><strong>The graph shows the percentage of people visiting the cinema once a month or more between 1984 and 2003 (4 age groups). Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Cinema Visits by Age Group (1984&ndash;2003)</em></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\"><em><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"34582860\">Xem livestream giải đề n&agrave;y c&ugrave;ng thầy Phạm Minh Khoa (<span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>2 lần 9.0</strong></span>) <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NrlYZfmn_XE&amp;feature=youtu.be\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">tại đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute;!</a></span></span></em></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề + Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LTWRd3roXobNoqxk11flz6gNgDd\">Đề b&agrave;i Cinema Visits by Age Group (1984&ndash;2003) y&ecirc;u cầu chung ta m&ocirc; tả biểu đồ đường về tỷ lệ người thuộc c&aacute;c nh&oacute;m tuổi kh&aacute;c nhau đi xem phim &iacute;t nhất một lần mỗi th&aacute;ng trong giai đoạn từ năm 1984 đến 2003.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qa0CdRUZSoFGk4x54mulgr2SgHg\">Với dạng line graph (số liệu c&oacute; thay đổi theo thời gian), ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh cần đề cập c&aacute;c th&ocirc;ng tin sau trong Overview:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NAOlddFXeovGeBxcbB6lSZGDgSd\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>[Trend - tăng/giảm/kh&ocirc;ng đổi]:</strong> tất cả c&aacute;c nh&oacute;m tuổi đều tăng (độ phổ biến của việc đi xem phim tăng)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FeN9drRZdoGSWvxzmSqlf9MWgdl\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>[So s&aacute;nh - lớn nhất/ nhỏ nhất/ thay đổi nhiều nhất]: </strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EEkcdEmJEo38FPxtybglLokugjh\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li>nh&oacute;m tuổi 15-24 th&iacute;ch đi xem phim nhất</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NpbndjkCNo2zdUxAL38lklYigyb\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li>nh&oacute;m người tr&ecirc;n 35 tuổi th&igrave; lại kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; hứng th&uacute; nhất</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IFf1dMjRDok8HtxlXSUlI37OgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng ph&acirc;n chia 2 đoạn BODY</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LsSad0NX3o7q6NxCHuflGAWFgtb\">Ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh chọn chia phần th&acirc;n b&agrave;i Cinema Visits by Age Group (1984&ndash;2003) <em>theo nh&oacute;m tuổi theo tỷ lệ cao thấp:</em></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YwdXd1aVPogOU5xRroMlfpIWgrg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>[BODY 1 - hai nh&oacute;m tuổi c&oacute; tỷ lệ lớn nhất]:</strong> nh&oacute;m 15-24 v&agrave; nh&oacute;m 7-14</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QO3Xd386goTUzDxJ4ZClEjXRgfe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>[BODY 2 - hai nh&oacute;m tuổi c&ograve;n lại]: </strong>nh&oacute;m 25-35 v&agrave; nh&oacute;m 35 trở l&ecirc;n</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Định hướng sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong từng BODY</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LZsFdjXnNo7GdWxSF49l55SVgdf\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LZsFdjXnNo7GdWxSF49l55SVgdf\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>[BODY 1]</strong>: <strong>hai nh&oacute;m tuổi c&oacute; tỷ lệ lớn nhất</strong></span></h4>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZVrHd9SxVo5bhFx0DThlzWNsgYe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu ban đầu</strong> của nh&oacute;m 15-24 <em>(~20%)</em> v&agrave; nh&oacute;m 7-14 <em>(10%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L9NHd14TEoIwyOxAfrklqZHYgIe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 2) <strong>Xu hướng tăng của nh&oacute;m 15-25</strong> <em>(tăng đến 32% v&agrave;o năm 1992, dao động trong 9 năm tiếp xeo, v&agrave; sau đ&oacute; tăng đến 57% v&agrave;o năm 2003).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GHaHdle7HoflCfxntIxlZjUSg9b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 3) Tương tự l&agrave; <strong>xu hướng tăng của nh&oacute;m 7-14</strong> <em>(tăng đến 18% năm 1992, tiếp tục tăng v&agrave; đạt 30% v&agrave;o năm 2003)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ck5JdjD6ioFpgOx1PcJlhXv6g5d\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LJ8ad6NKIojkuuxPnOZlO5HigKX\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>[BODY 2]</strong>: <strong>hai nh&oacute;m tuổi c&ograve;n lại</strong></span></h4>\n<div><strong>Bạn h&atilde;y thử tự viết BODY 2 m&agrave; kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; phần discussion nh&eacute;.</strong></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Định hướng về cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EbdzdJffdoBZqKxeXbWll5Negjt\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C&aacute;c bạn c&oacute; thể tham khảo cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u sau đ&acirc;y nh&eacute;:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EbdzdJffdoBZqKxeXbWll5Negjt\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<table class=\"ace-table\" data-ace-table-col-widths=\"170;208;484\"><colgroup><col width=\"170\"><col width=\"208\"><col width=\"484\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WDPbdnQcjoZn3Lx6mlulXZz7gcc\"><strong>Chức năng</strong></div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FmzYduyO0op4ScxsztllyK70gsc\"><strong>Cấu tr&uacute;c</strong></div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEW0dntU8ocZiBx5Rznl4oQpgwb\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ</strong></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ObFzdN9FCooaoAxQSCGlccMlgrc\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng với động từ</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D8Kid9up0oBnpBxjz39leQBcgKe\">V + ADV</div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WsYddN9NTobqAkx4pjcl1oDTg6g\">The younger bracket&rsquo;s numbers <strong>increased significantly</strong> to nearly a quarter of respondents in 2003</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QHFrdOR8PoSbtdx1an1lkbZpgcg\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>M&ocirc; tả xu hướng dao động</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PsMSdrRY3oxEXFxNAM5lRLdLgvb\">fluctuate (Around + Number)</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LxM2dwJ53oRYZNxgqxPl1Fcrgjb\">Fluctuation</div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ec1ZdaZY3oPlOnx8mtJlglftgGe\">An upward trend was recorded for the former group, with its figures rising to around 30% in 1993, before <strong>fluctuating</strong> in the next 9 years and increasing again to approximately 55% in 2003.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XPCHdrnmdoBP5JxP288lreNLguh\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FLg5dPJaooF6hjxsp46lXNMhgmf\">The younger bracket&rsquo;s numbers increased significantly to nearly a quarter of respondents in 2003, despite some <strong>fluctuations</strong> from 1996 to 2003.</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: justify;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"3\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KIMEdOpFRoKIwax1h2cl1wM2gle\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>Gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; xu hướng tương đồng</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: justify;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ncp3d80LVo9BJ7xtlgDlSxfNgKd\">A similar increasing/ decreasing tendency was seen in ...., as ....</div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K0DCdJrD1ow6I2xcimElz6yygAe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>A similar increasing tendency was seen in the 7-14 age bracket, </strong>as the numbers also rose to around 30% in 1993</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 233,
